Oplus hardware fixes for crDroid
Source snapshot: 2026-10-07.

UPSTREAM SOURCES AND COMPATIBILITY

This distribution contains source-code diffs for crDroid branch 16.0 (Android 16).
Other ROMs are outside the current scope. It is not a ROM image and contains no
vendor binaries, firmware or driver source. Both patches only add validation and
read-back logic to code that already exists in the tree: the Lineage touch HAL
implementation for Oplus devices and the LTPO settings activity. No kernel node,
driver, panel configuration or touch sampling rate is changed, and no feature is
enabled that was not enabled before.

